     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">在文化碰撞中拓宽视野，在异域行走间收获成长<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">——关于选拔优秀学生赴加拿大短期学习交流的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">如果你想体验国外课堂、感受先进教育，如果你想融入全英环境、大胆说练口语，如果你想参访加拿大名校、提前留学规划，如果你想入住加拿大家庭、体验海外生活，如果你想游历风景人文、感悟多元文化，如果你还想……那么，</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年的暑假，就能满足你的所有愿望！为期</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>13</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">天的加拿大短期学习交流之旅将带你领略全新的世界，挑战独立的生活。根据学校工作安排，现将选拔部分优秀学生出访加拿大温哥华。相关选拔事宜通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 39.0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">一、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">出访时间：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="2" Month="8" Year="2017"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">——</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 39.0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">二、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">出访人员：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT size=3>现高一、高二学生</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 39.0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">三、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">出访内容：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>*</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">互动学习</SPAN> </B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">碰撞智慧：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">1</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、“</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>ESL</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">英语课程”</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：走进全英语的学习环境，全面提高英语的听说读写能力</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">。</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>ESL</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>English as a Second Language</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">，以英语为第二语言</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>/</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">外语）是提供给</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><A href="http://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%AF%8D%E8%AF%AD/18742" target=_blank><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>母语</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">非英语并把英语作为第二语言的语言学习者的专业英文课程。</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2.“</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">与当地学生互动学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">习</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">与加拿大师生一起，体验不同的加拿大课堂。教学内容涉及有领导力培养、美术、体育、英语、科学等方面，具体内容由加方学校安排。</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>*</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">名校游览</SPAN> </B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">收获满满：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">参观不列颠哥伦比亚大学（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>UBC</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">），该校与麻省理工学院、斯坦福大学齐名，是</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>G13</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">大学联盟、英联邦大学协会、环太平洋大学联盟和</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>U21</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">成员之一，培养了包括</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">位诺贝尔奖得主在内的众多世界顶尖人才。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>*</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">寄宿家庭</SPAN> </B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">深层交流：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT size=3>晚上回寄宿家庭，参加各自的家庭活动，感受加拿大温馨舒适的家庭生活和社区环境。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>*</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">参观考察</SPAN> </B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">开拓视野：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、寻找温哥华的历史韵味：游览温哥华的发源地“盖士镇”、温哥华的象征“加拿大广场”、“一生必去的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">个旅游胜地”之一“卡皮拉诺大吊桥”、温哥华市中心“格兰维尔岛”，并畅游北美著名的城市森林公园斯坦利公园，去感受印第安部落的图腾文化和狮门大桥的雄伟气魄。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、品味维多利亚的如画风景：欣赏乔治亚海峡与布查德花园的明媚风光，参观省议会大厦和维多利亚内港。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、感受美加边境的文化融合：穿越永不关闭的美加边境大门，踏上美国领土拍照留念，并游览边境小镇“白石镇”。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">、体验空中飞行的惊险刺激：观看</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>4D</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">电影“飞越加拿大”，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US> 30</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">分钟的模拟飞行，让你穿过尼亚加拉大瀑布、国会山庄、冰川等地点，空中横跨加拿大。学习航空飞行知识，并在教官的带领下亲自操作飞机，当回小小飞行员。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 39.0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">四、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">报名要求：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT size=3>1、</FONT><SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT size=3>要求参加交流的同学热爱祖国，遵守纪律，品质端正，有较强的生活自理能力，无严重违纪记录，身体健康，无严重疾病和影响出国旅行的病情。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT size=3>2、</FONT><SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">要求参加交流的同学，填写电子申请表并打印（报名表在通知末尾），经学生本人及家长签字后于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>18</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日（周二）放学前交到对外交流中心（行政楼</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>207</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">室）。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 39.0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">五、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">费用：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.47" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">人民币</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>29800</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">元</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>/</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">人，包括加拿大签证费、食宿费、往返机票、保险费，不包括护照制作费、超重行李托运费、境外通讯费、境内外个人消费等）。多退少补。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">六、其它说明：</SPAN></FONT></P>
